e":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-06-24T00:08:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T08:30:28Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T21:52:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot version: v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\nReproducible in: v4.6.3.stable, v4.7.stable and potentially older versions\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.5.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (WebGL 2.0) (Compatibility) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nTextures compressed using `Basis Universal` method aren't being rendered correctly in Safari (Version 26.5) and Chrome (Version 149.0.7827.196) when using web export\nThe same textures behave normally when exporting to non-Web platform (e.g. Android)\nAll other compression methods are working correctly\n\nScreenshots:\n\n<img width=\"963\" height=\"650\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/904d66b1-48df-4552-9b11-f4a9849d5174\" />\n\n<img width=\"698\" height=\"547\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6eafe77f-8905-4eb4-8849-7c81696e4780\" />\n\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a3f13eb-26bb-4328-9154-9ee257c60262\" />\n\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4fd67c7d-99d1-4d1a-97c1-901464376543\" />\n\nUnlike Chrome, Safari logs the function call that failed \n\nThe issue seems to be on the Godot's side, because Safari and Chrome support all the necessary compression types (checking using https://toji.github.io/texture-tester/):\n\nSafari texture report:\n<img width=\"575\" height=\"804\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/832c63ce-5614-4459-a2fb-2268fb6f81b6\" />\n\nChrome texture report:\n\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"787\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4196188-25e0-4b26-a422-2afcee23290e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Import any image\n* In Import tab set Compress Mode to `Basis Universal`\n* Quickly export to web using Remote Deploy\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[troubleshoot.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29271935/troubleshoot.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597/timeline","performed_